					"nextDialogs": [
						80110503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110503,
					"content": "（锁链层层缠绕，悬吊在空中，散发着不祥的气息…没错，和「污秽逆位神像」非常类似！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110504,
					"content": "（果然和深渊教团有关系吗，这些正在膜拜的丘丘人，也像极了当时的「那个家伙」…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110505,
					"content": "埃德，这里很不吉利，快走！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110506,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110507,
					"content": "埃德？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110508,
					"content": "…生命啊，为何在跪拜呢，因恐惧未知而跪拜？因贪图力量而跪拜？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110509,
					"content": "（什么声音，好像从我头脑里传来的…埃德，好像听不到？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110510,
					"content": "…生命啊，为何在跪拜呢，我又不是什么神明，我只是——「罪人」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110511,
					"content": "（「罪人」…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110512,
					"content": "诞生于罪孽，但尚且无垢的花朵啊，我通晓你的命运。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110513,
					"content": "无需压抑你一切的不甘，无需容忍那全部的谎言。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110514,
					"content": "去成为「超然」的存在吧，超越一切「被赋予的命运」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110515,
					"content": "我将在时间的尽头垂泪…回望你的一切。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110516,
					"content": "（…你究竟是谁，这些话是什么意思？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110517,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110518,
					"content": "（声音…消失了么…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110519
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110519,
					"content": "！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110520,
					"content": "…埃德？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110521,
					"content": "呼…呼…刚才发生了什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110522,
					"content": "我好像见到那东西的瞬间，内心所有的情绪都平息了，只剩下说不出是敬畏…还是幸福的感觉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110523,
					"content": "你现在没事了么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110524
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110524,
					"content": "没事，我感觉很好，不如说…比刚进来这里的时候要好多了，真是奇怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110525,
					"content": "这里有问题，我们赶紧离开吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110526
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110526,
					"content": "是、是吗…好吧，那先听你的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110527,
					"content": "你们从诡异的洞穴离开后，直接回到了埃德的小屋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
